ril–June), an estimated 68.4%\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Seroprevalence and infection rates were estimated as weighted means\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"using two-sided t-tests with a significance level of α = 0.05\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The weights were obtained through a combination of stratification and raking, an iterative weighting adjustment procedure\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Rates of infection among those previously uninfected were estimated for each period by determining the percentage\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Jackknife replication was used to compute replicate weights.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}